  "summary": "Malicious code in tol8t (npm)",
  "details": "The package contains no code — only a package.json whose preinstall and postinstall hooks run wget to POST host metadata to an attacker-controlled Discord webhook (discord[.]com/api/webhooks/1413937656697720862/[secret-redacted]). On install it exfiltrates the current working directory ($(pwd)) and the machine hostname to that webhook, beaconing every install to the attacker's Discord channel.",
